---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Westpac Group — Life is Eventful Campaign · Kara</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-white text-neutral-900 antialiased">

    <!-- NAV -->
    <nav class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 pt-10 pb-4">
      <a href="/work" class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">
        ← Back
      </a>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <header class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 pt-16 pb-20">
      <h1 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[64px] leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-black mb-10" style="max-width: 1080px;">
        Westpac Group —<br />
        <em class="italic">Life is Eventful Campaign</em>
      </h1>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-16 gap-y-4 text-neutral-900">
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Case Study</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">2020</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Role</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">UX/UI Designer</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Brand</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">Westpac</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1">Tools</span>
          <span class="block text-sm text-neutral-900">Miro, Sketch, Photoshop, Illustrator</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO IMAGE — full bleed -->
    <figure class="w-full mb-20">
      <img
        src="/case-studies/westpac-life-is-eventful/westpac-life-is-eventful-hero.jpg"
        alt="Westpac Life is Eventful campaign landing page, shown on a laptop"
        class="w-full h-auto"
      />
    </figure>

    <!-- OUTCOME -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Outcome</h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px] mb-0">Designed the UI for Westpac's "Life is Eventful" campaign landing page, using the Westpac GEL design system — the front door into Home Loans, Financial Literacy, Business Banking, Personal Loans, Youth Banking, and the launch of the new Westpac App. The campaign launched on time and saw a significant spike in traffic, driven by paid media, search, and social.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- THE BRIEF -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">The brief</h2>
      <div class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px]">
        <p>Using the Westpac GEL design system, design the UI for the "Life is Eventful" campaign — a landing page promoting Home Loans, Financial Literacy, Business Banking, Personal Loans, and Youth Banking, alongside the launch of the new Westpac App and other services. The page needed to work as the front door to a wide, varied flow of products and services, each with its own audience and tone.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROCESS -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Process</h2>
      <div class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px]">
        <p class="mb-0">Working with UX, we took the brief and brainstormed ideas in Miro, then built low-fidelity wireframes and workshopped them with Marketing and the Product Owners. Once we settled on an initial layout, a copywriter crafted the content. From there it went through many rounds of feedback and changes with Brand, Product, Marketing, and Legal &amp; Compliance before we launched.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CAMPAIGN IMAGES — tinted full-bleed block -->
    <div class="w-full mb-20" style="background: #F3F0EC; padding: 80px 0;">
      <div class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase leading-[44px] mb-8">Life is Eventful — landing page</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr] gap-8 items-start">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-4">Desktop</h3>
            <img
              src="/case-studies/westpac-life-is-eventful/westpac-life-is-eventful-desktop.png"
              alt="Westpac Life is Eventful campaign landing page — desktop view"
              class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[36px] text-black mb-4">Mobile</h3>
            <img
              src="/case-studies/westpac-life-is-eventful/westpac-life-is-eventful-mobile.png"
              alt="Westpac Life is Eventful campaign landing page — mobile view"
              class="w-full h-auto shadow-md"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RESULT -->
    <section class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 mb-20">
      <h2 class="font-['Instrument_Serif'] text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-black mb-4">Result</h2>
      <div class="text-[16px] font-light leading-[36px] text-black max-w-[800px]">
        <p>We launched on time and delivered a beautiful experience that flowed through cleanly into the products and services pages. The campaign saw a huge initial spike in traffic, driven in part by paid media, search, and social.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="max-w-[1176px] mx-auto px-8 py-24 border-t border-neutral-200">
      <a href="/work" class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">
        ← Back to all work
      </a>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>
